# The image is built from exactly these inputs; everything else (tests, documents, the
# corresponding-source record, scratch files) stays out of the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!MANIFEST.sha256
!artifacts/
!rootfs/
**/*.actual
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# The license files that go into the image (see the Dockerfile), gathered by build.sh into
# legal-stage/: the application license, the notice, the third-party notice summary, the
# source record, the build scripts it names and the license texts.
!legal-stage/
